0000199 \"mechanoreceptor\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D006198\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"WikipediaVersioned:Hair_cell&oldid=1045345915\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000202 \"A mechanoreceptor cell of the auditory or vestibular system that is sensitive to auditory stimuli. The accessory sensory structures are arranged so that appropriate stimuli cause movement of the hair-like projections (stereocilia and kinocilia) which relay the information centrally in the nervous system.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_0000202 \"auditory receptor cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D013823\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MP:0000971\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000205 \"A cellular receptor which mediates the sense of temperature. Thermoreceptor cells in vertebrates are mostly located under the skin. In mammals there are separate types of thermoreceptors for cold and for warmth and pain receptor cells which detect cold or heat extreme enough to cause pain.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D002628\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000206 \"A cell specialized to detect chemical substances and relay that information centrally in the nervous system. Chemoreceptors may monitor external stimuli, as in taste and olfaction, or internal stimuli, such as the concentrations of oxygen and carbon dioxide in the blood.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000207 \"BTO:0004185\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000207 \"FMA:67860\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000207 \"MESH:D018034\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000207 \"Wikipedia:Olfactory_receptor_neuron\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000207 \"Schultze's cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000207 \"odorant receptor cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000207 \"olfactory receptor neuron\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000207 \"olfactory sensory neuron\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0618947256\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000209 \"A specialized cell involved in gustatory sensory perception.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000209 \"FMA:67910\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000209 \"taste bud cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D010786\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000210 \"A cell specialized in detecting light stimuli that are involved in visual perception.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000210 \"BTO:0001060\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000210 \"CALOHA:TS-0868\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000210 \"FMA:86740\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"FB:ma\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000211 \"A cell whose function is determined by the generation or the reception of an electric signal.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"CL:CVS\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000212 \"OBSOLETE. A cell that takes up and metabolizes substances.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"JB:jb\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000213 \"OBSOLETE. A cell within an epithelial cell sheet whose main function is to act as an internal or external covering for a tissue or an organism.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000213 \"boundary cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000214 \"CALOHA:TS-0995\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000214 \"synoviocyte\")\nSubClassOf(Annotation(oboInOwl:is_inferred \"true\") obo:CL_0000214 obo:CL_0002078)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"JB:jb\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000215 \"OBSOLETE. A cell whose primary function is to prevent the transport of stuff across compartments.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D012708\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000216 \"A supporting cell projecting inward from the basement membrane of seminiferous tubules. They surround and nourish the developing male germ cells and secrete androgen binding protein. Their tight junctions with the spermatogonia and spermatocytes provide a blood-testis barrier.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000216 \"BTO:0001238\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000216 \"CALOHA:TS-0922\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000216 \"FMA:72298\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000216 \"VHOG:0001348\")\nSubClassOf(Annotation(oboInOwl:is_inferred \"true\") obo:CL_0000216 obo:CL_0000630)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:cvs\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D012583\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000218 \"A neuroglial cell of the peripheral nervous system which forms the insulating myelin sheaths of peripheral axons.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:CL_0000218 \"Schwann cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:CL_0000218 \"peripheral neuroglial cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000218 \"CALOHA:TS-0898\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000218 \"FMA:62121\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000218 \"neurilemmal cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"FB:ma\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000219 \"A cell that moves by its own activities.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider obo:CL_0000220 \"CL:0000000\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider obo:CL_0000220 \"CL:0000003\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider obo:CL_0000220 \"CL:0001034\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D004475\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000221 \"A cell of the outer of the three germ layers of the embryo.\")\nAnnotat