s modular and topographically organized architecture. It plays an essential role in regulating motor coordination and potentially cognitive functions.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_2000027 \"2014-06-25T00:24:03Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_2000027 \"cerebellum basket cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:CL_2000027 \"CL:2000027\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/>) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1016/j.cnp.2022.11.002\") foaf:depiction obo:CL_2000027 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/images/CB_circuits_PMID3650468_f2.png>)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/>) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.3389/fnins.2020.00293\") foaf:depiction obo:CL_2000027 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/images/Candelabrum_cell.png>)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000028 \"Any glutamatergic neuron that is part of a cerebellum.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_2000028 \"2014-06-25T00:24:10Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:CL_2000028 \"CL:2000028\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000029 \"Any neuron that is part of a central nervous system.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_2000029 \"2014-06-25T01:17:43Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:CL_2000029 \"CL:2000029\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000030 \"Any native cell that is part of a hypothalamus.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_2000030 \"2014-06-25T01:17:50Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:CL_2000030 \"CL:2000030\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000031 \"Any n